WEBVTT

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.250
It’s done!

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.670
<i>For lack of a budget, I just shaped and cooled some melted chocolate.{よさん => "budget"}{Since there wasn’t a budget to work with, it’s really just a shaped and hardened chocolate bar,}</i>

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.630
<i>I wonder if she’ll like it.</i>

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.210
<i>Valentine’s day chocolate!</i>

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.470
<i>I really want to hurry up and give it to her!{unf}</i>

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.640
Yamada Kyou.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.440
Yes!{yes sir}

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.520
I did it!{Hooray vs I pulled it off, huh?}

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.890
Despite sleeping in class…{too long?}

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.060
Onee-chan!{ni?}

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.440
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.290
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.050
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.850
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.260
This is our home.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.950
But, when spring comes…

