00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:46.760
<i>Maybe I’ll never be able to
give her chocolate again.{Even if she just ignored it all and accepted it,}</i>

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.490
<i>Even if she accepted my chocolate,{technically speaking this should be "were to accept" but I think I’ll be lazy and just let it pass}</i>

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.030
<i>and she said she was really happy to get it,</i>

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.030
<i>it wouldn’t be the thing that
truly makes her happy any more.{Fuck this entire monologue. Fuck it to hell.}</i>

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:16.960
<i>Because Onee-chan has somehow managed to find someone who she likes even more than me.</i>

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.880
<i>I’m just getting in her way.</i>

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.080
<i>Asu.</i>

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:40.300
<i>What I should really be doing is cheering her on.</i>

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:44.630
<i>{What are these feelings?}Why do I feel this way?</i>

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.000
Ah, that’s him.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.090
I wonder who he’s waiting for?

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.480
Could it be? Onee-chan?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.340
Why… with another girl?

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.650
Why?

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:50.170
Asu!

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:52.860
Asu!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.360
Onee-chan!

00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.140
Asu!

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:03.240
Thank goodness! So this is where you were.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.090
Th-Thank you.

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.730
H-Hey, Onee-chan!

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.500
Earlier, over there…

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.940
Um, er… there…

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:13.200
Pork buns!{Niku (肉) is the word for meat, but I’m going with the rule of cool on this one. To quote wikipedia (which as we all know, can never be wrong), "It is a kind of chūka man (中華まん lit. Chinese-style steamed bun) similar to the Chinese baozi (包子), also known in English as pork buns."}

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.480
Th-Th-That’s right! Pork buns!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:19.750
Earlier, I saw a store over there with Pork Buns on sale for 10 yen apiece!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.970
10 yen?! Where? Where was it?

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.470
<i>Oh no! I made them way too cheap!</i>

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.420
If we don’t hurry up, they might sell out!{OH NOES THE PORK BUNS HAVE SOLD OUT! NOW THEY ONLY PLAY POP MUSIC}

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.790
Where was it?

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.530
Um… It was…

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:33.720
That way!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.730
Roger that! It’s that way!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.430
Asu, let’s go!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.270
Where is it, Asu?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.110
Er… Huh… Where was it…?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.410
Maybe they already sold out…

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:53.090
What?! No way…{D:}

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.860
I wanted to eat them together with you.{does that mean kyou is a cannibal}

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:00.050
<i>If she finds out that the guy she likes already has a girlfriend,</i>

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:02.120
<i>Onee-chan will probably be really sad.{disappointed}</i>

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.110
<i>No way.</i>

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:09.220
<i>If he’s the type to accept one girl’s chocolate and then go off holding another girl’s hand,{Did I just turn "cocolate" into some sort of sexual-innuendo-related word?}</i>

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.880
<i>it’s probably better if she
doesn’t get along with him.{bah this is terrible too}</i>

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.830
Ah! Uh… Onee-chan, here it is!

