Ah! 10 yen! You were right!{DEUS FUCKING EX FUCKING MACHINA}{Also, Kyou is being a redundant derpface}

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.280
You’re amazing, Onee-chan… You actually found them.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.780
What are you talking about? You’re
the amazing one for finding them earlier!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:48.290
Ah! Anyway, let’s hurry up and go in!

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:52.250
<i>Please, just walk past the store while we’re inside!</i>

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.580
Welcome!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:58.430
Um… are these pork buns really 10 yen each?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.140
Yes, ma’am. They’re part of a promotional campaign.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:02.260
Would you like to buy one?

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:04.270
Two, please.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:07.000
<i>But if she were to see him holding hands
with someone else or something like that,</i>

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:11.410
<i>Onee-chan probably wouldn’t like him anymore.</i>

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:13.150
<i>That means I’d—</i>

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:25.620
<i>For her sake… There is something I can do!</i>

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.330
Onee-chan!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.460
What is it, Asu?

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.630
Onee-chan, it’s the perfect chance!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.010
Let’s buy two more pork buns!
That way each of us can have two!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.310
That’s great! The two of you are getting along well!{the two of you have gotten together}

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:52.270
I ran away without giving an explanation, so I was worried things wouldn’t turn out well.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.410
I see, I see!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.090
I’m really happy too!

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:58.580
Great, great!{That’s great!}

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:01.870
If you ever need help again, tell me.{If something happens later, tell me.}{KYOU IS TOO TALL TO FIND A MAN WHO WILL LOVE HER}

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.200
Sure! Thank you!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:16.080
You see, I was asked to give him
that chocolate on her behalf.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.920
S-So that’s what happened.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.890
<i>I jumped to conclusions and made a big
deal out of nothing. How embarrassing.{a mountain out of a molehill}</i>

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.790
I’m sorry it caused a misunderstanding.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.430
But, you know, Asu,

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:35.510
if you’re worried that something like that
might happen in the future, remember this:{suspicious : usage}

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.940
I will never abandon you.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.030
Ever!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.240
Yes.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.550
That said, I think the fact that you
were so jealous made me a little happy.{ITE: Kyou is a sadist}

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.500
What is it? What’s wrong?

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.160
I don’t care.{I wasn’t jealous!}{I DON’T KNOW AND I FEEL NOTHING}{TSUNDERE ASUCHAN}

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.560
Sorry, sorry! Are you mad?{u mad bro}

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:11.740
I don’t care.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:14.520
Hey, don’t leave me behind!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:18.500
<i>It’s things like worrying about someone else,</i>

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.040
<i>bringing along a coat to protect them from the cold,{Bringing that person a warm coat to wear…}{getting that nice and warm feeling inside because of it}</i>

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.280
<i>and searching for cheap pork buns just so
you’ll be able to eat them together.</i>

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:31.310
<i>When I think that one day, Onee-chan will do these things with someone other than me,{idk about that first comma but I am too lazy to remove it}</i>

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:34.290
<i>I can’t help but feel a little sad.</i>

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:41.620
<i>I imagine that even when that time comes,
Onee-chan will assure me I won’t be left alone.</i>

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:46.120
<i>But is that something I can just agree with?</i>

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.940
<i>Maybe, when that time comes…</i>

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.730
By the way, Asu.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:56.350
Who was this chocolate intended for?

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.610
My favorite person!

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:10.430
Huh?! Who’s that?!

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.890
Wait up, Asu!

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:15.950
Who is your favorite person?

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:22.140
<i>When that time comes, I’ll definitely choose whatever makes my favorite sister happy.{lolz}</i>

